<title>USA: Allied Waste sells Canadian operations.</title>
<headline>Allied Waste sells Canadian operations.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Waste Industries Inc said Thursday it had agreed to sell its Canadian solid waste management operations for about $518 million cash to USA Waste Services Inc.</p>
<p>USA Waste and some subsidiaries will acquire solid waste operations in six Canadian provinces, including 41 collection companies, eight transfer stations, 10 recycling facilities and seven landfills, Allied Waste said.  </p>
<p>--</p>
</text>
